=== 1. THE GUARD EXPRESSION: SINGLE DIM OR SLICE? ===
  w.shape=(3,)  w.shape[axis_w:=-min(dw,2)] = 3  type=int
  w.shape=(3, 4)  w.shape[axis_w:=-min(dw,2)] = 3  type=int
  w.shape=(3, 4, 1)  w.shape[axis_w:=-min(dw,2)] = 4  type=int
  w.shape=(3, 4, 5, 6)  w.shape[axis_w:=-min(dw,2)] = 5  type=int

